      "items": [
        {
          "zh": "客家話有六個**聲調**，其中兩個是**入聲**。以上是一至四調的符號示範。",
          "en": "Hakka has six **tones**, two of which are **Entering Tones**. The above are examples of the symbols for tones 1 to 4."
        },
        {
          "zh": "「你」在客家話有**口語音**和**讀書音**的不同。惠陽腔客家話中，**口語音**是 `ngī`，**讀書音**為 `lí`。",
          "en": "The character 你 (you) in Hakka has both **colloquial** and **literary** pronunciations. In Fuiyong Hakka, the **colloquial** pronunciation is `ngī`, while the **literary** pronunciation is `lí`."
        },
        {
          "zh": "「數」的發音只有一個 `sù`，沒有其他發音。",
          "en": "The character 數 ('number', 'count') has only one pronunciation: `sù`. There are no other pronunciations."
        },
        {
          "zh": "客家話 21～29，**口語**可以說 {兩十一}、{兩十二}、... {兩十九}，廣州話、普通話不能這樣說。",
          "en": "In Hakka **colloquial** language, numbers 21-29 can be said as {兩十一}, {兩十二}, ... {兩十九}. This is not done in Cantonese or Mandarin."
        }
      ]
    }
